    "source": "",
    "copyright": "Rekhi Bharat, in: WHO Classification of Tumours Editorial Board. Genetic tumour syndromes [Internet; beta version ahead of print]. Lyon (France): International Agency for Research on Cancer; 2023. (WHO classification of tumours series, 5th ed.; vol. 14). https://tumourclassification.iarc.who.int/chapters/67.",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoTableGrid\" style=\"background: #daeef3; border-collapse: collapse; border: none;\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 450.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"601\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Caf&eacute;-au-lait skin macules with characteristic features, including jagged borders and a distribution respecting the midline of the body</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 450.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"601\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Polyostotic or monostotic fibrous dysplasia</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 450.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"601\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Any of the following endocrinopathies:</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm 3pt 36pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Gonadotropin-independent precocious puberty</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm 3pt 36pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Testicular lesions with or without precocious puberty</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm 3pt 36pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Thyroid lesions with or without non-autoimmune hyperthyroidism</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm 3pt 36pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Growth hormone excess or mixed growth hormone and prolactin excess</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm 3pt 36pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Renal phosphate wasting with or without hypophosphataemia</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm 3pt 36pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Neonatal Cushing syndrome</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
